This directory contains Forseti's longitudinal [`hugi`](https://github.com/boxxxie/hugi) + [`obench`](https://github.com/zeybek/obench) benchmark suite (`{{ this.total_benchmarks | int }}` benchmarks across `{{ this.group_count | int }}` groups, `{{ this.total_samples_str | raw }}` samples at commit `{{ this.commit | raw }}` in [`history.hugidb`](history.hugidb)), visual SVG charts rendered via [`runa`](https://github.com/boxxxie/runa) under [`renders/`](renders/), and a `--profile-1m` telemetry sweep.

